                <mxCell id="layer2" value="MCP Validator (Dual-Mode)&lt;br&gt;• Rule-based: fast deterministic matching&lt;br&gt;• LLM-powered: call get_syllabus_topics() tool&lt;br&gt;• Validate against syllabus boundaries&lt;br&gt;• Detect wrong facts in questions&lt;br&gt;• Output: VALID/WARNING/OUT_OF_SYLLABUS/REJECTED&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
